window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Never run from an Alpha.</p> <p>As the only werewolf immune to the curse forcing my kind to shift every night, I'm a bit of a hot commodity . . . and not in a good way.</p> <p>I went to New York thinking it would be the safest place to hide. Wrong decision.</p> <p>The city is home to one of the largest packs in the world. Its leader? Tall, strong, sexy, and determined that I'm his.</p> <p>When my scent starts driving unmated men insane, that giant, possessive beast who won't leave me alone is the only one who can protect me.</p> <p>One way or another, I'm totally screwed.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
